From: clawd20130 <clawd20130@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 02:11:47 +0900
Subject: KWin: send the output's GPU completion fence instead of glFinish

When the Android host offers zwp_linux_explicit_synchronization_v1 (KGSL has
no DRM syncobj), export an EGL native fence for each output frame and attach
it with set_acquire_fence in the same commit; the render thread no longer
blocks in glFinish. MOTO_KWIN_EXPLICIT_SYNC=-1 restores the old path.
Packaged as 6.6.6-0ubuntu0.1+moto8. Measured: Paint p50 6.7 -> 2.0 ms.

Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-09-26
X-Rungic-Status: Inappropriate [Android host specific: runs nested in the Android APK compositor]
X-Rungic-Tests: L3:perf.compositor
X-Rungic-Docs: docs/57
Origin: vendor, commit:5127264a
